          "type": "FAQ",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Q1：Your recent Venustas heated apparel.",
            "body": "<p>Women’s Waterproof Heated Lightweight FELLEX® Jacket 12V (W20) and Women's Classic Heated Vest 7.4V, W2118. <br/><br/>I’ve been using both the heated jacket and the heated vest from Venustas recently. Both are great, but they serve slightly different purposes for me. The jacket is perfect for really cold days, especially when I’m outdoors or around camp and need that extra full-body warmth. The vest is my go-to for chilly mornings when it’s cold at first but warms up later in the day. It keeps my core warm without feeling too heavy. Overall, I love how versatile both pieces are depending on the weather and activity.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_4qgXVw": {
          "type": "FAQ",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Q2: How does Venustas heated apparel change your lifestyle?",
            "body": "<p>Venustas heated apparel has made it much easier for me to enjoy being outside in colder weather. It keeps me comfortable while I’m hiking, taking photos, or spending time around camp, so I’m not constantly distracted by the cold. I can stay out longer and focus more on what I’m doing instead of cutting things short because of the temperature. It’s also been really helpful when traveling, since it adds warmth without needing bulky layers, which makes everything feel more simple and comfortable.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_V6DeFn": {
          "type": "FAQ",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Q3: Which part most appealing to you about Venustas?",
            "body": "<p>The most appealing part of Venustas heated apparel for me is its versatility. Being able to switch the heat settings depending on the conditions makes it really practical for different types of days outdoors. Some mornings I don’t need much warmth at all, while other times I can turn it up when it gets colder, which makes it easy to stay comfortable without having to constantly change layers.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_PK86tz": {
          "type": "FAQ",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Q4: How do you feel about Venustas heated apparel?",
            "body": "<p>Overall, I’ve really enjoyed my experience with Venustas heated apparel. The products feel well-made and practical, and they’ve been great for keeping me comfortable during cold outdoor days.<br/><br/>I’ve also had a positive experience working with the Venustas team. They’ve been communicative, supportive, and easy to collaborate with, which made the whole process smooth and enjoyable.</p>"
