            "body": "<p>I feel I’m a great fit as a V+ Master because my lifestyle is very connected to the outdoors and staying active in all kinds of conditions. I spend a lot of time hiking, photographing nature, and exploring different environments, so I really value gear that is functional and easy to rely on. That aligns closely with Venustas’ philosophy of creating warmth that fits into real life. Simple, practical, and supportive of being outdoors without distractions.</p>"
